---
import Layout from '../layouts/StandardLayout.astro';
const example = `{
  "specVersion": "0.1",
  "id": "plan-authentication",
  "revision": 1,
  "project": { "id": "customer-platform" },
  "title": "Corporate SSO",
  "intent": "Internal users authenticate through corporate SSO.",
  "outcomes": [{ "id": "sso", "title": "Corporate users can authenticate using SSO." }],
  "acceptanceCriteria": [{ "id": "ac-1", "outcomeId": "sso", "statement": "Corporate SSO login succeeds." }]
}`;
---
<Layout title="Quick Start"><section class="page"><p class="eyebrow">ORBIT v0.1 · Draft</p><h1>Start with one outcome.</h1><pre class="code">{example}</pre><h2>Observe, reconcile, execute</h2><p>Observe current project state. Reconcile the plan against that state. Generate one bounded slice. Execute through the provider of your choice. Repeat.</p></section></Layout>
